==Battleground==
*1 [[Angelic Sleipnir]] spawns after 3.33 seconds<sup>100f</sup>.
*2 [[Sister Lione]]s spawn after 6.67 seconds<sup>200f</sup>, delay 53.33 seconds<sup>1,600f</sup>.
*4 [[Gabriel]]s spawn after 16.67 seconds<sup>500f</sup>, delay 16.67 seconds<sup>500f</sup>.
*6 [[Gabriel]]s spawn after 96.67 seconds<sup>2,900f</sup>, delay 10~16.67 seconds<sup>300f~500f</sup>.
