*3 [[Lione Hippoe]]s spawn after 73.33 seconds<sup>2,200f</sup>, delay 16.67 seconds<sup>500f</sup>.

==Strategy==
This is a relatively easy stage, although it is unexpectedly difficult when compared to the previous stages of the event.

As long as you bring three or four meatshields and a number of damage dealers who can outrange Sister Lione (such as [[Lizard Cat (Normal Cat)|Dragon Cat]], [[Archer Cat (Rare Cat)|Cataur]], [[Ururun Wolf (Special Cat)|Ururun Cat]] and [[Bahamut Cat (Special Cat)|Crazed Bahamut Cat]]), you are unlikely to have any problems dealing with this stage. Just make sure to manage your money properly. You can also try your luck with [[Rocker Cat (Rare Cat)|Artist/Ramen Cat]], but he will only help you against the Angel enemies in the stage. Bringing Rich Cat and Cat CPU can make things easier, but are not necessary.

